00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.613
Hmm.

00:17:24.613 --> 00:17:26.220
No one thinks about what
their cat thinks of them.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.133
Cause I think--

00:17:27.133 --> 00:17:27.966
They know.

00:17:27.966 --> 00:17:28.799
Right.

00:17:28.799 --> 00:17:30.420
