00:37:12.737 --> 00:37:14.400
And then they're just
teeth start falling out

00:37:14.400 --> 00:37:16.700
because they have not
coupled eating sugary foods

00:37:16.700 --> 00:37:18.260
with modern dental hygiene.

00:37:18.260 --> 00:37:19.093
Hmm.

00:37:19.093 --> 00:37:20.190
You got to have both of those together.

00:37:20.190 --> 00:37:21.680
And even sometimes if you do,

00:37:21.680 --> 00:37:24.687
if you don't do a good job
cleaning those wisdom teeth,

00:37:24.687 --> 00:37:26.903
they're gonna have to
pull 'em out someday.

00:37:28.290 --> 00:37:30.620
So I don't know, I don't really understand

00:37:30.620 --> 00:37:32.360
why we don't have the backup teeth,

00:37:32.360 --> 00:37:33.990
but it was just determined to not

00:37:33.990 --> 00:37:36.900
