00:37:43.369 --> 00:37:45.950
That's what's been so scary for me.

00:37:45.950 --> 00:37:46.890
All these years.

00:37:46.890 --> 00:37:47.723
Yeah.

00:37:47.723 --> 00:37:49.990
My father in law pulled
mine because he's a dentist.

00:37:49.990 --> 00:37:54.010
