so, my roots were twisted--

00:38:09.742 --> 00:38:10.728
Oh!

00:38:10.728 --> 00:38:12.194
And my head was like,

00:38:12.194 --> 00:38:13.220
Ugh! Ugh! Ugh!

00:38:13.220 --> 00:38:15.410
Like you know, he was like...

